import{_ as o,o as n,c as i,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 643 | Acceleration-Domain Depth | The Technology-Explosion Model in the Acceleration Domain","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 643 | Acceleration-Domain Depth | The Technology-Explosion Model in the Acceleration Domain","no":643,"module":3,"tags":["Acceleration Domain","Technology Explosion","Technology Model","Origin Acceleration Domain","Civilizational Technology"],"related":["16-Multiplication-Fruit Technological Principle","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","11-Deduction Iteration System Details"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0643_模块3-加速域深度-加速域中的技术爆炸模型.md","filePath":"en/0643_模块3-加速域深度-加速域中的技术爆炸模型.md"}'),a={name:"en/0643_模块3-加速域深度-加速域中的技术爆炸模型.md"};function l(r,e,s,c,d,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-643-acceleration-domain-depth-the-technology-explosion-model-in-the-acceleration-domain" tabindex="-1">Entry 643 | Acceleration-Domain Depth | The Technology-Explosion Model in the Acceleration Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-643-acceleration-domain-depth-the-technology-explosion-model-in-the-acceleration-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 643 | Acceleration-Domain Depth | The Technology-Explosion Model in the Acceleration Domain&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 16, 15, 11 | Series: Acceleration-Domain Depth (Entry 2)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-hundredfold-iteration-stacked-with-hundredfold-feedback-is-the-engine-of-technology-explosion" tabindex="-1">Introduction: hundredfold iteration stacked with hundredfold feedback is the engine of technology explosion <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-hundredfold-iteration-stacked-with-hundredfold-feedback-is-the-engine-of-technology-explosion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: hundredfold iteration stacked with hundredfold feedback is the engine of technology explosion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Technology explosion in an ordinary civilization is a vague concept — referring to the phenomenon of technology suddenly accelerating. But in the Origin Acceleration Domain, technology explosion is not a vague phenomenon, but a deterministic process that may be modeled, predicted, engineering-guided. Its engine has two: hundredfold iteration (deduction-speed amplification) and hundredfold feedback (Myriad-Rank feedback-speed amplification). The two stack, and technological development shifts from linear growth to exponential explosion.</p><p>Six top-level axioms take effect here: anti-predation axiom requires technology-explosion results come from incremental development; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires technology results network-wide shared; collective ascension axiom requires technology explosion serve Myriad-Rank joint progress; causal self-discipline axiom requires technology explosion not produce uncontrollable causal overflow; law-first axiom requires technology-explosion model&#39;s law definition stable and self-consistent. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry disassembles the complete model of technology explosion in the acceleration domain.</p><h2 id="i-three-engine-structure-of-technology-explosion" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Engine Structure of Technology Explosion <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-engine-structure-of-technology-explosion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Engine Structure of Technology Explosion&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-engine-1-deduction-acceleration-engine" tabindex="-1">1.1 Engine 1: Deduction Acceleration Engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-engine-1-deduction-acceleration-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Engine 1: Deduction Acceleration Engine&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The deduction iteration system (Document 11) operates under hundredfold flow, technology-deduction speed magnified a hundredfold. This means: a technology deduction that in an ordinary civilization takes a hundred years completes in one year (intra-domain time) in the acceleration domain; outside only about three days passed. Deduction acceleration is technology explosion&#39;s first driving force.</p><h3 id="_1-2-engine-2-feedback-acceleration-engine" tabindex="-1">1.2 Engine 2: Feedback Acceleration Engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-engine-2-feedback-acceleration-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Engine 2: Feedback Acceleration Engine&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After technology results feed back from the acceleration domain to the real plane, Myriad-Rank usage feedback is rapidly collected through the Alaya Network. In an ordinary civilization, a technology from release to collecting enough feedback data may take years; in Heng Yuan Zhou, feedback is real-time summarized through the Alaya Network; Myriad-Rank usage data, problem reports, improvement suggestions within hours may be transmitted back to the acceleration domain. Feedback acceleration makes technology iteration&#39;s direction correction more precise.</p><h3 id="_1-3-engine-3-cross-disciplinary-fusion-engine" tabindex="-1">1.3 Engine 3: Cross-Disciplinary Fusion Engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-engine-3-cross-disciplinary-fusion-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Engine 3: Cross-Disciplinary Fusion Engine&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Inside the acceleration domain cultivators of the five lineages simultaneously converge — the human-race technical route, the exotic-beast race&#39;s natural route, the mechanical race&#39;s engineering route, the consciousness race&#39;s information route, the mixed race&#39;s cross-disciplinary route — under hundredfold flow they collide, cross-fuse. This cross-disciplinary fusion in an ordinary civilization may take hundreds of years to accidentally occur; inside the acceleration domain it may systematically arise within dozens of intra-domain years.</p><h2 id="ii-the-exponential-curve-model-of-technology-explosion" tabindex="-1">II. The Exponential-Curve Model of Technology Explosion <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-exponential-curve-model-of-technology-explosion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Exponential-Curve Model of Technology Explosion&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Time Node (External)</th><th>Technology Maturity</th><th>Key Milestone</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Day 1</td><td>Baseline</td><td>Technology direction selected</td></tr><tr><td>Day 3</td><td>10×</td><td>First hundredfold deduction iteration completed</td></tr><tr><td>Day 10</td><td>100×</td><td>Ten iterations completed, technology prototype formed</td></tr><tr><td>Day 30</td><td>1000×</td><td>Hundred iterations completed, technology enters practical stage</td></tr><tr><td>Day 100</td><td>10000×</td><td>Technology matures and begins cross-disciplinary fusion</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This exponential curve is not a theoretical assumption, but an engineeringized model jointly driven by the deduction iteration system + Multiplication Fruit (Document 16) + Alaya Network feedback.</p><h2 id="iii-safety-boundaries-of-technology-explosion" tabindex="-1">III. Safety Boundaries of Technology Explosion <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-safety-boundaries-of-technology-explosion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Safety Boundaries of Technology Explosion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Technology explosion is not technology out of control. Technology explosion in the acceleration domain has three safety boundaries:</p><h3 id="_3-1-causal-closure-boundary" tabindex="-1">3.1 Causal-Closure Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-causal-closure-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Causal-Closure Boundary&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Technology deduction and experiments inside the acceleration domain proceed in a causal-closed space (Entry 640 time-causal unity); technology explosion&#39;s causal consequences do not overflow to external reality.</p><h3 id="_3-2-feedback-audit-boundary" tabindex="-1">3.2 Feedback-Audit Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-feedback-audit-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Feedback-Audit Boundary&quot;">​</a></h3><p>When technology results exit the acceleration domain, they must pass Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s causal audit. Technologies that pass audit may feed back to the real plane; technologies that fail audit continue to be corrected inside the acceleration domain.</p><h3 id="_3-3-ethical-review-boundary" tabindex="-1">3.3 Ethical-Review Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-3-ethical-review-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.3 Ethical-Review Boundary&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Technologies involving high-risk domains (such as cross-plane operations, large-scale energy scheduling) must pass the Anchor Council&#39;s ethical review before feeding back. Technology explosion may not break through ethical boundaries.</p><h2 id="iv-technology-explosion-and-the-quest-domain-s-coordination" tabindex="-1">IV. Technology Explosion and the Quest Domain&#39;s Coordination <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-technology-explosion-and-the-quest-domain-s-coordination" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Technology Explosion and the Quest Domain&#39;s Coordination&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Technology explosion does not mean civilization may &quot;only want fast not deep.&quot; Technologies produced by the acceleration domain need the Quest Sediment Domain to digest:</p><ul><li>New technology&#39;s social impact needs deep simulation in the Quest Domain, evaluating its long-term impact on Myriad-Rank life;</li><li>Ethical questions brought by new technology need philosophical contemplation in the Quest Domain, not only accelerated deduction;</li><li>New technology&#39;s cultural acceptance needs immersive testing in the Quest Domain, ensuring Myriad Ranks are not overwhelmed by technology explosion.</li></ul><p>Dual-track synergy: the acceleration domain is responsible for technology explosion&#39;s &quot;fast,&quot; the Quest Domain for technology digestion&#39;s &quot;deep.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: technology explosion converts deduction time investment into feedback-able technology results; every bit of hundredfold flow corresponds to measurable technology increment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: technology-explosion results all feedback network-wide; there is no case of &quot;the strong monopolizing technology&quot;; technology comes from incremental development, not plundering stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system technological development is grace-style (whatever the system gives is used), no autonomous explosion capability; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s technology explosion is co-built by Myriad Ranks, results network-wide shared</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: technology-explosion three engines converge five-lineage cultivators; technology results equally open to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: technology-explosion model&#39;s law definition, engine parameters, safety boundaries all public; newly merged planes接入 the same technology-explosion infrastructure; the technology system leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Technology explosion is not an accidental phenomenon, but the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s engineeringized product. Hundredfold deduction + hundredfold feedback + cross-disciplinary fusion three engines stacked, turning technological development from linear growth to exponential explosion. But explosion has boundaries — causal closure, feedback audit, ethical review three safety boundaries ensure technology explosion serves civilization, not destroys civilization. <strong>This is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s complete definition of &quot;technology explosion&quot;: fast, but safe; exploding, but controllable</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication-Fruit Technological Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction Iteration System Details</a> · <a href="./644_模块3-加速域深度-加速域中的修炼效率极限.html">Entry 644 · Cultivation-Efficiency Limits in the Acceleration Domain</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const y=o(a,[["render",l]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
